  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demonstration of stand alone trackers in the Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of the demonstration project is to prove that the technology actually functions under the specific climatic conditions.This entails evaluating the technology&apos;s performance and its maintenance requirements.These unique selling points (USPs) must be validated by practical results to convince both potential users and financiers of the technology&apos;s effectiveness and reliability.</narrative>
  </description>
